    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install openwork
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit installer at install time and runs it silently. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install openwork --version=<version>
```

## What is Openwork?

The open-source alternative to Claude Cowork (powered by opencode).

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade openwork
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall openwork
```

